<title>USA: DCI signs agreement to buy Muller Media.</title>
<headline>DCI signs agreement to buy Muller Media.</headline>
<dateline>FAIRFIELD, Conn. 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>DCI Telecommunications Inc said Wednesday that it signed a definitive agreement to acquire Muller Media Inc, which is expected to generate $3.0 million in annualized sales and $0.5 million in profits.</p>
<p>Muller Media, a New York-based privately held entertainment company, reported a $2.6 million backlog.</p>
<p>The purchase would involve an exchange of 1.2 million shares of DCI stock, the company said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
